{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n1958年，第一包即食麵誕生，麵條已經係波浪形狀架啦。有冇諗過點解即食麵嘅麵條，都係波浪形，唔係直條呢？等@ __hazel.nut 話你知！\n</p>\n<p>第一：慳包裝空間！ 同樣長度嘅麵條，波浪狀佔用面積細好多，大大降低運輸同包裝成本！<br/>\n第二：防黐底、煮得快！彎曲造型能增加空氣同水流接觸，防止麵條黏在一齊，先做到3分鐘就食得！<br/>\n第三：防碎！油炸後嘅麵條極度脆弱，波浪結構抗壓性更好，運輸唔易碎！<br/>\n第四：方便夾嚟食！ 如果係直條麵，用筷子或叉夾好容易跣走，仲會彈到周圍都係！波浪狀就剛好卡住，唔怕整污糟！</p>\n<p>快D share俾好鍾意食即食麵嘅朋友啦～</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951760725493978_15942889536b00368909d04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951760725493978_15942889536b00368909d04.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、AI生成影片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df9ZGMkl7oo/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:23:59.181904+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:01:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:37:36.936274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:17:24.251632+00:00","content_hash":"dfba6390d4d2bb68b3b3278808b9c76b54ae9f000650ab678e3380c9660a625b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}